        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m01",
          "sender": "tess",
          "text": "Hi Bree. Why would I go to the police about you?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m02",
          "sender": "bree",
          "text": "sorry sorry I know that sounds bad"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m03",
          "sender": "bree",
          "text": "Margo told my mom you were asking about me. In this town that's basically a subpoena"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m04",
          "sender": "bree",
          "text": "June was the only person who ever explained things to me properly"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m05",
          "sender": "bree",
          "text": "Before she died she asked me some questions about the count. I didn't know what to say"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m06",
          "sender": "tess",
          "text": "What questions?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m07",
          "sender": "bree",
          "text": "I can't do this over text, I'm sorry, I'm not trying to be weird"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m08",
          "sender": "bree",
          "text": "I just need to be sure about something first. Then I'll tell you everything I promise"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m09",
          "sender": "tess",
          "text": "Bree, if you know something about the count, the safest thing for you is to tell someone now."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m10",
          "sender": "bree",
          "text": "I know. I know. Please give me till the weekend"
        }
      ],
