        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m02",
          "sender": "paul",
          "text": "Between us, Bree's had a hard year. Money troubles, her mum's not well. Go easy on her, eh?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m03",
          "sender": "tess",
          "text": "I haven't been hard on anyone, Paul."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m04",
          "sender": "paul",
          "text": "Of course not! June was very fond of her. We all are."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m05",
          "sender": "paul",
          "text": "Random question, did the police ever trace that number? The one sending those texts? Glen mentioned it at the counter. Awful thing to do to a family!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m06",
          "sender": "tess",
          "text": "Not that I know of."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m07",
          "sender": "paul",
          "text": "Shame! Let me help however I can. I'll send over June's delivery log, you'll want it for the insurance."
        }
